# 1.25 Carat Marquise Diamond Price ({{year}}): 4 Grade Combos Under $4K

![Three loose 1.25 carat marquise natural diamonds held in jeweller tweezers against a soft grey backdrop as the DiamondCritics featured image for the {{year}} 1.25 carat marquise diamond price budget grade combos guide](/images/1-25-carat-marquise-diamond-price.jpg "1.25 Carat Marquise Diamond Price 4 Grade Combos Under 4K")

## TL;DR — 1.25 Carat Marquise Diamond Price in One Scroll

