The absolute cheapest certified 1.25ct marquise in current market inventory is **$792** for IGI E-VVS2 Excellent Cut lab-grown. The natural floor is **$8,000** for GIA H-VS1 Very Good Cut. The gap is **$7,208** — a 1,010% natural premium for the same face-up size.

