> **"When clients ask me which lab stone to buy at 1.25ct, I almost always say Combo 3. The $430 premium over the budget floor buys the Ideal cut label and the VVS1 clarity step. Both are visible on paper, both matter in the HD video. That is where the money lands best at this size."** — Farzana Hasan, GIA Diamond Expert

