**Verdict:** The setting budget decides more about the final ring than the stone grade does at 1.25ct. A $1,222 Combo 3 stone in a $2,778 platinum halo reads like a $7,000 ring. A $8,000 natural stone in a $1,000 basic prong reads like a $9,000 ring. Smart buyers allocate 55–70% of budget to the setting at this tier.

